<title>SWEDEN: Kinnevik '96 profit falls to 159 mln Skr.</title>
<headline>Kinnevik '96 profit falls to 159 mln Skr.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish holding company Kinnevik presented on Monday these earnings for the 12 months to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>					(million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>							     PROFORMA '95</p>
<p> Profit after fin items		 159    vs   1,010</p>
<p> Sales				    9,744    vs   9,621</p>
<p> Earnings per share (crowns)	 4.38    vs  10.27</p>
<p> Depreciation			     625    vs     656</p>
<p> Operating profit after deprec	595    vs   1,212</p>
<p> Net financial items	   CHARGE 417    vs     335 CHARGE</p>
<p> Minorities			CHARGE  23    vs     1 CREDIT</p>
<p> Net profit				 374    vs     323</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (crowns)	     5    vs	 5</p>
<p> Net asset value per share (crowns) 215    vs     227</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of holding company is Industriforvaltnings AB Kinnevik.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
